[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m The real part of this expression is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Combining the terms, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
