[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m The real part of this expression is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta.
