[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m To maximize \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\), we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -432\), so the maximum value is:
