[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Then, \(\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}e^{-i\theta} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Now, we can substitute \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Simplifying the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144i\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Separating the real and imaginary parts, we get:
