[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Next, let's simplify \(\frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m = \frac{96\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144i\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4}
