[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m Combining these two parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m = (300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
