[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). To maximize this real part, we need to maximize the expression \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=353998)[0m \[
